WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.020
Hey, you...

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:03.730
Huh?

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:06.480
Aren't you dragging your foot a bit?

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.870
Uh, yeah...

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:11.910
I twisted it earlier when my foot slipped.

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:15.240
But it will be fine.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:17.620
Honestly...

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:19.620
Hey!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.680
What are you doing?

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.960
No! Where are you touching?!

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:24.790
All right.

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:26.060
Huh?

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.420
Ah...

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:46.160
On the way home, neither of us said a word.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.950
I wonder what she is thinking about at this moment...

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.850
What is she hoping for at this moment?

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:03.630
I wonder if it would be okay if I asked her about it...

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:13.050
When I think back upon it,

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:14.480
at that time,

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:18.050
that was probably my last chance to save her.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:55.820
Rea.

00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.070
Rea.

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.240
Foolish daughter.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:06.740
Did you think I wouldn't notice?

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:10.710
I shall not let you sneak out again!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.250
No.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.130
Nor go to school!

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.960
No!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.050
You will never see anyone else again.

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:21.430
I'm sick of this lifestyle.
You will never see anyone else again.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.680
You won't have any friends.
I'm sick of this lifestyle.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:26.720
All you need is me.
I'm sick of this lifestyle.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.640
With this poison, I will put an end to everything...

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:31.440
All you need is me.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:58.710
I see...

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.760
I did not die.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:23.950
Good morning, Otou-sama, Okaa-sama.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.490
Ah, good morning, Rea.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:32.080
I heard that you broke your promise and snuck out last night.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:32.960
What is the meaning of this?

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.170
I'm sorry, Okaa-sama.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:39.630
Because the moon was so beautiful,

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:42.670
I unconsciously went out into the woods.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:43.630
Exactly...

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.510
You really need to pay more attention, you know?

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:48.600
Because your actions affect how others value me.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.770
Could you please stop?

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.850
There's no need to speak to Rea like that, is there?

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:54.440
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.190
Okaa-sama, your food?

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:56.940
I don't need it.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.780
Rea, I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.450
For hitting you like that.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.960
No, I deserved it.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.370
I did something I should not have done.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.880
I really appreciate you, Otou-sama.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.880
That's right.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.260
It would be better if you understood.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:30.140
Rea,

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:35.140
I am the only one who can protect you.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.020
Yes.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:46.490
By the way, Rea, why are you wearing your uniform?

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:50.240
I thought I told you that you are going to be home schooled from now on.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:53.950
T-That you did.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.790
Sorry.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.370
Danichirou-sama.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.550
Rea, get changed.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.380
Yes, I understand.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:19.190
Did you find out anything?

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:24.650
Yes, I figured out who the boy from last night was.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.320
He appears to be a student from Shiyou High School.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:30.110
He's the son living in the temple on 2nd street.

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:31.660
Hmm, I see.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.910
By any chance, is he talking about Furuya-kun?

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:38.410
So, in order to make sure he never comes near Rea again,

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.460
castrate him.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.260
W-What does he mean by that?

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.850
Furuya-kun is in danger.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.260
What are you saying?

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.020
I don't believe it...

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.810
You made a drug to bring the dead back to life...

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:00.520
...and made Babu-chan drink it?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.650
What were you thinking?

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:06.780
Furthermore, you're a priest's son, seriously...

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:09.990
Hey, Nero-chan, this is immoral, isn't it?

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:11.410
Yes, truly.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:17.290
I always knew my brother's abnormal love of zombies was in bad taste,

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:18.910
but I never thought it would go this far.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:20.920
Shut up. I don't want to hear that from you.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:26.170
Yeah, I've probably done something disgusting...

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:31.760
But it really did bring Babu back to life!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:37.260
Hey, aren't you happy? Babu came back to life.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:42.600
Well, I am happy, but...

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:46.270
B-But to really have brought him back to life...

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:47.690
...something like that is...

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.110
Well then, what is that?

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.990
Babu.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:57.580
See, that characteristically nasal roar is definitely Babu.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:58.620
Eh? Even if that's true, something's really strange.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.870
Babu!

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:03.540
It's me!

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.380
Look, aren't his eyes really bright?

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:10.550
I mean, before he was so emotional, and now...

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:13.180
But his features haven't changed.

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.220
I wonder if it's all right.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.010
What do you mean?

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:21.310
Well, if he really did come back to life,

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:24.350
won't he attack people like a zombie?

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.650
So won't the people he bites also become zombies?

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.650
Isn't that how you said it would end?

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:34.610
No, there's no way something out of a manga could...

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.410
You're absolutely positive about that?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:38.580
Ah!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.540
Hey, wait a minute!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.500
Wait for me!

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:48.750
Hey, Nii, your bag.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.260
I don't need it. I'm skipping school today!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:54.630
Good grief.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:57.700
Huh? What?

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:58.930
What's going on?

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.260
Ah, Grandpa.

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:04.350
Something about my brother bringing Babu back to life.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.770
We will be taking care of another cat again.

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:09.440
Hoho... is that so?

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.280
He brought Babu back to life.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:13.780
Good, good.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.450
Babu.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.460
That's strange.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:28.670
Normally he lets me catch him easily.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:29.210
Hold on.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.590
Isn't it dangerous to catch him with your bare hands?

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:47.350
Wanko-san, don't you have morning training?

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.100
Hurry and go to school.

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:53.650
As your older sister, I am obligated to look after you.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.740
You're my cousin.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:55.530
Babu.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.990
Ah, he went in there.

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.490
No way! You're going in?

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.220
Hmm?

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.600
Would you like a drink?

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.690
Fine, abuse your power as many times as you want.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:49.040
So long... I can't even see the other side.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:52.250
W-Wait a minute.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.800
It's rubbing...

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.300
How far does this go?

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.180
Hold on.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.560
My butt got stuck and I can't move!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.980
I know Babu-chan is important,

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.070
but also show some concern for me!

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:17.900
You can hear me, can't you?!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.740
Chihiro, you idiot!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.880
Finally the exit... Eh?

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.220
This place is...

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:47.260
...right below that place?

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:51.520
Babu.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.700
Hey, Mogi.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.450
You like baseball?

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:08.120
Huh? Yeah, watching it.

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.200
So, what about women?

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:12.870
Just looking...

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.540
You only look, huh?

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:19.920
That's the reason you aren't growing.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:23.630
Is it here? How about here?

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:25.890
Maybe over here? How about there?

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.270
Ah, this sucks.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.940
Even though I sexually harass Mogi,

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:37.480
it's just Mogi in the end.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:41.280
What are you saying, Yasutaka?

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.860
I don't get what you mean.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:45.860
As I thought, this is how a lady of Sanjou...

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:47.280
Um, excuse me.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.540
There is something I would like to ask.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:55.960
Um, is Fu-Furuya-kun...

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.210
...there?

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:02.760
Eh, what was that?

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:07.720
Well, like I said, the first year student Furuya Chihiro-kun.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:08.970
Fu...

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:09.970
Ru...

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:11.220
Chi...?

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:13.770
Do you know anything, Mogi-kun?

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.390
Um, well...

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:18.190
It seems like he didn't come to school today.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.320
Is that so...?

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:25.030
What do you want with him?

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.740
What do you want?!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:30.660
Um... Ah... Well...

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:35.160
H-He is going to be castrated.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:39.500
R-Right now. She just said...

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.090
...c-ca...

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.050
N-Never mind.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:44.830
Thank you very much.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:52.560
Why are you going to castrate Furuya?!

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.520
I was so nervous.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.770
I-I did not say anything strange, right?

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:07.030
I wonder where Furuya-kun is.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:18.210
What? Rea went outside?

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.600
No. That is fine.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.550
Follow her.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.760
Why do you not listen to what I say?

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.140
Why?

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.680
I don't understand...

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:56.540
Damn it, where did Babu go?

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:01.880
Damn that Wanko. She didn't follow me.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.210
To look after me, what kind of obligation is that?

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.800
Crap, looks like it's going to rain.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:15.350
There he is.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.770
He's eating the hortensia leaves.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:33.780
Wait a moment, this wouldn't happen to be...

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:45.420
As I thought, this is the cliff she climbed yesterday.

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:48.090
Huh?

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:51.590
What is she doing here at this time?

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:57.560
If he is waiting at the usual run-down hotel,

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:01.100
I am sure I will be able to meet him if I go there.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.900
Because of me...

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:13.200
I don't want to cause Furuya-kun trouble....

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:16.490
Where do you intend on going, Rea?

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.370
A walk through the woods?

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:24.580
If that's the case, it seems you've gone a little too far.

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.030
Who is that?

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:31.920
By any chance, is that Rea's father?

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.100
Come now, let's go home together.

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:37.800
If we go now, I am still willing to forgive you.

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.430
You are such a smart girl.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:49.190
Because you are a Sanka, you are also my daughter.

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:49.940
No.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.040
What are they talking about?

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.910
What's going on?

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:07.420
What is the meaning of this, Rea?

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.840
Otou-sama...

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:13.050
Certainly...

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:18.680
Certainly I am your daughter...

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.930
But that is why...

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:27.310
...not all of my heart and body belong to you.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.810
Just a little is fine.

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:32.570
Please give me...

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:35.820
...freedom.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:38.320
Freedom?

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.910
What type of freedom?

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:43.790
Try saying it.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.210
What's wrong?

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:51.420
Are you saying you simply want the freedom to go outside?

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:54.010
Or perhaps...

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:56.340
...the freedom to love?

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:02.810
Babu.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.020
Wait.

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.440
Please stop, Otou-sama.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:12.070
Just today, just give me today.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:12.940
It's useless.

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:15.940
You were just going to meet that Furuya boy anyway.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.320
Babu.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.660
What... What is that? That filthy cat.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:24.950
Babu-chan.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.580
Stop it.

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:32.130
Don't come any closer, I'm allergic.

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:33.170
Babu-chan.

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.210
Wait.

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:35.020
No way.

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.970
I can't believe it.

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.930
You've really been resurrected.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.010
Stop.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.430
Don't touch it.

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:42.430
You'll be corrupted.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:47.060
Perhaps Furuya-kun perfected the drug since then?

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.440
Or perhaps...

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:52.940
That drug really did work.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.860
Rea, move.

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:00.570
Stop, Otou-sama!

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:13.040
Rea!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:17.050
Furuya... kun...

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:59.050
Rea...

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:13.190
Hey, say something!

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:21.030
For you to really die...

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:26.070
This is too much of a joke.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.200
Please bring me back to life.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.410
Please.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:37.630
I can't do it...

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.220
Kun...

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.020
Furuya... kun...

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:01.990
Eh?

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:07.990
Furuya... kun...

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:17.710
Impossible...

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:20.880
You didn't take any part of the drug...

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:23.670
Why...

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:28.090
It's god!

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:31.510
D-Danichirou-sama

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.690
Furuya-kun...

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:44.740
As you promised,

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:49.530
please take responsibility, okay?

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:56.040
Uh...

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:02.460
Yes.

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:06.470
Babu.

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:49.900
In conclusion, I've been causing a lot of trouble.

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:52.700
Ah, I've met the person who wrote this.

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:55.240
I was able to talk to him thoroughly.

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:57.910
Next time, on Sankarea.

00:23:57.910 --> 00:24:02.420
Episode 4: An Ordinary Girl.

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:03.420
Everyone, come and see.

00:24:04.390 --> 00:24:06.960
Now that I understand his intention,

00:24:07.310 --> 00:24:09.670
I won't hesitate anymore.
